  "required_revision": {
    "finding": "A7a/A7b call save and project directly after separately admitting a job. The sole included in-process adapter, routeFixtureRequest, returns raw internal admission outcomes and never delegates persistence or response projection to those operations. Thus the component checks do not establish the accepted design's adapter path for either an immediate response or saved progress.",
    "change": "Add a disposable orchestration path with trusted analysis identity and epoch carried from admission into save and projection. Exercise revocation before save and after save before return through that path, for immediate and partial results. Assert no stale saved update, no old job or evidence in projected output, and no duplicate or deleted intake effect. Keep the existing direct mutation and query checks. Make the intended relationship between saved analysis identity and its linked intake effects explicit in the fixture instead of relying only on matching scope and epoch.",
